{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"a2-exam","level":"A2","kind":"exam","title":{"de":"A2-Abschlusstest","bn":"A2 লেভেল টেস্ট"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Nachdem alle angekommen ___, haben wir gegessen.","options":["sind","hatten","waren"],"answer":2,"explanation":"nachdem + Plusquamperfekt: waren angekommen","id":"a2-exam-q1"},{"type":"order","prompt":"আমি জার্মান শিখি, কারণ আমি জার্মানিতে কাজ করতে চাই।","promptBn":"শব্দগুলো সাজিয়ে বাক্যটি তৈরি করুন","words":["Ich","lerne","Deutsch,","weil","ich","in","Deutschland","arbeiten","möchte"],"accept":["Weil ich in Deutschland arbeiten möchte, lerne ich Deutsch"],"extra":["Du","möchten"],"id":"a2-exam-q2"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich weiß nicht, ___ der Zug pünktlich kommt.","answers":["ob"],"options":["ob","dass","wann"],"promptBn":"হ্যাঁ/না প্রশ্ন","explanation":"ob → ক্রিয়া শেষে","id":"a2-exam-q3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Obwohl das Wetter schlecht war, ___ wir viel Zeit draußen verbracht.","options":["sind","hatten","haben"],"answer":2,"explanation":"verbringen → haben","id":"a2-exam-q4"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich interessiere mich ___ IT und Elektrotechnik.","options":["für","auf","über"],"answer":0,"explanation":"sich interessieren für","id":"a2-exam-q5"},{"type":"order","prompt":"তবুও যাত্রাটা আনন্দদায়ক ছিল।","promptBn":"শব্দগুলো সাজিয়ে বাক্যটি তৈরি করুন","words":["Trotzdem","war","die","Reise","angenehm"],"accept":["Die Reise war trotzdem angenehm"],"extra":["warst","der"],"id":"a2-exam-q6"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Gestern ___ ich lange arbeiten. (müssen)","answers":["musste"],"options":["musste","muss","müsste"],"promptBn":"müssen-এর অতীত","id":"a2-exam-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Er hat ___ Mutter Blumen geschenkt.","options":["seiner","seine","seinen"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Dativ: die Mutter → seiner","id":"a2-exam-q8"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Die neue Wohnung liegt ___ an der Universität als die alte.","options":["am nächsten","näher","nah"],"answer":1,"explanation":"nah → näher","id":"a2-exam-q9"},{"type":"order","prompt":"আপনি কি দয়া করে বলতে পারবেন, স্টেশন কোথায়?","promptBn":"শব্দগুলো সাজিয়ে বাক্যটি তৈরি করুন","words":["Könnten","Sie","mir","bitte","sagen,","wo","der","Bahnhof","ist"],"accept":[],"extra":["die"],"id":"a2-exam-q10"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich habe noch ___ Biryani gegessen.","answers":["nie"],"options":["nie","nicht","mehr"],"promptBn":"কখনো না","id":"a2-exam-q11"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich wohne in einer ___ Wohnung.","options":["kleiner","kleinen","kleine"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Dativ → -en","id":"a2-exam-q12"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„die Verantwortung“ মানে …","options":["অভিজ্ঞতা","দক্ষতা","দায়িত্ব"],"answer":2,"id":"a2-exam-q13"},{"type":"order","prompt":"তোমার উত্তরের অপেক্ষায় আছি।","promptBn":"শব্দগুলো সাজিয়ে বাক্যটি তৈরি করুন","words":["Ich","freue","mich","auf","deine","Antwort"],"accept":[],"extra":["Du","dein"],"id":"a2-exam-q14"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Bevor ich zur Arbeit gehe, ___ ich meine E-Mails.","answers":["lese"],"options":["lese","liest","lesen"],"promptBn":"মূল বাক্যের ক্রিয়া প্রথমে","id":"a2-exam-q15"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich lege das Handy auf ___ Tisch.","options":["dem","der","den"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Wohin? → Akkusativ","id":"a2-exam-q16"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Sehr geehrte Damen und Herren, … Mit freundlichen ___","options":["Grüßen","Grüße","Gruß"],"answer":0,"id":"a2-exam-q17"},{"type":"order","prompt":"আমি অনলাইনে টিকিট কিনেছি।","promptBn":"শব্দগুলো সাজিয়ে বাক্যটি তৈরি করুন","words":["Ich","habe","die","Fahrkarte","online","gekauft"],"accept":[],"extra":["Du","hat"],"id":"a2-exam-q18"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Hier darf ___ nicht rauchen.","answers":["man"],"options":["man","jemand","niemand"],"promptBn":"সাধারণভাবে সবাই","id":"a2-exam-q19"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich hoffe, dass ich mein Ziel bald ___.","options":["erreiche","erreichen","erreichst"],"answer":0,"explanation":"dass → ক্রিয়া শেষে","id":"a2-exam-q20"}]},"schema":1,"id":"a2-exam","level":"A2","test":[]}